      "n": "#89·17",
      "text": "A sleek black slip dress with thin straps and a V-neckline, made of smooth satin-like fabric that drapes elegantly along your figure. It’s simple yet sophisticated, perfect for evening events."
    },
    {
      "n": "#294·16",
      "text": "Knee-high green suede boots with a block heel and pointed toe. Their soft texture adds depth to the outfit, while the high heel gives you confidence and height."
    },
